{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16769","headline":"前年春与独孤常州兄花时爲别倏已三年矣今莺花又尔覩物增怀因之抒情聊以奉寄 · 李幼卿","name":"前年春与独孤常州兄花时爲别倏已三年矣今莺花又尔覩物增怀因之抒情聊以奉寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近日霜毛一番新，别时芳草两回春。\n不堪花落花开处，况是江南江北人。\n薄宦龙锺心懒慢，故山寥落水奫沦。\n缘君爱我疵瑕少，愿窃仁风寄老身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李幼卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}